cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AnnoTuneAgent: cluster-level cell-type annotation"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the software record below and pin
  the package version used in the analysis.
abstract: >-
  Collects a marker score, a name-model result, and an ML-model result for
  each cluster. A judgment reads the three results and writes the title.
  The title is a dictionary name. The name model reads dictionary marker
  hits. The ML model is trained on differential expression and marker-panel
  statistics.
type: software
